Pesquise jurisprudência, legislação e decisões com mais agilidade e concentre-se no trabalho jurídico.</p></article><article class="surface-card p-6 "><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-graduation-cap h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg><h3 class="min-w-0 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Estudantes de Direito</h3></div><p class="label-mono mt-3">Estudo e pesquisa</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Pesquise assuntos jurídicos, compreenda decisões e aprofunde seus estudos.</p></article><article class="surface-card p-6 "><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg><h3 class="min-w-0 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Concurseiros</h3></div><p class="label-mono mt-3">Revisão</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Utilize a inteligência artificial como apoio para pesquisa e revisão de conteúdos jurídicos.</p></article><article class="surface-card p-6 "><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><h3 class="min-w-0 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Outros profissionais</h3></div><p class="label-mono mt-3">Contábil, pesquisa e afins</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Consulte informações jurídicas para apoiar suas atividades profissionais.</p></article></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] scroll-mt-20 px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 border-t border-border"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="label-mono mb-4">Exemplos de uso</p><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">O que você perguntaria ao Ementa?</h2></div><ul class="mt-10 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface-card flex items-center gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0 text-sm">Quais são os requisitos jurídicos para este caso?</span></li><li class="surface-card flex items-center gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0 text-sm">Encontre decisões relacionadas a este tema.</span></li><li class="surface-card flex items-center gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0 text-sm">Explique este entendimento de forma simples.</span></li><li class="surface-card flex items-center gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0 text-sm">Quais fundamentos aparecem nas decisões sobre este assunto?</span></li><li class="surface-card flex items-center gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0 text-sm">Compare os diferentes entendimentos sobre esta questão.</span></li><li class="surface-card flex items-center gap-3 p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21 21-4.34-4.34"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0 text-sm">Resuma esta decisão em pontos objetivos.</span></li></ul></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] scroll-mt-20 px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 border-t border-border"><div class="surface-card mx-auto max-w-3xl p-8 text-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/200